OL,3,GNEWSATemporary A&E units planned for
OL,4,Ahospital car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FParts of a hospital's emergency
OL,7,Fdepartment will be moved into temporary
OL,8,Fbuildings in a car park while
OL,9,Frefurbishment work is carried out.
OL,11,FThe Norfolk and Norwich University
OL,12,FHospital (NNUH) is asking for planning
OL,13,Fpermission for a modular building that
OL,14,Fwill be in place for one year.
OL,16,FThe hospital said it would mean that
OL,17,Fcritical treatment can still be carried
OL,18,Fout while the existing emergency
OL,19,Fdepartment is refurbished.
